<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover"/>
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark"/>
<meta name="theme-color" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)" content="#FDFCF8"/>
<meta name="theme-color" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)" content="#000000"/>
<meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes"/>
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes"/>
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent"/>
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="Bey Companion"/>
<meta name="description" content="Beyblade League Season 2 companion — standings, profiles, predictor and records on your phone."/>
<link rel="manifest" href="data:application/octet-stream;base64,"/>
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="data:image/png;base64,"/>
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/png;base64,"/>
<title>Beyblade Mobile Companion</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@500;600;700;800;900&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#DDD9CC; --phone-bg:#FDFCF8; --surface:#FFFFFF; --surface2:#F3F1E9;
  --ink:#171A1F; --muted:#62676F; --line:#171A1F; --line-soft:#D8D5C9;
  --accent:#E94E1B; --accent-ink:#FFFFFF; --gold:#8A5E0B; --gold-bg:#FFF0CB;
  --green:#137547; --green-bg:#E2F2E7; --red:#B3372A; --red-bg:#FBEAE7;
  --mono:"IBM Plex Mono",ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,monospace; --sans:"Archivo",system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
  --nav-h:64px;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){
  :root{ --bg:#000000; --phone-bg:#000000; --surface:#0A0A12; --surface2:#141422; --ink:#F4F2FF; --muted:#A3A6BC; --line:#E6E4F2; --line-soft:#2E2E44; --accent:#C4B5FD; --accent-ink:#0A0A16; --gold:#E3B341; --gold-bg:#3A2F14; --green:#4CC38A; --green-bg:#173326; --red:#FF8A7A; --red-bg:#3A211D; }
  /* Purple-leaning accent on vanta black: dark text reads better on the pale accent */
  .install-btn{color:var(--accent-ink)}
  .rank-num.top{color:var(--accent-ink)}
  .day-badge{color:var(--accent-ink)}
  .btn.accent{color:var(--accent-ink)}
  .nav-btn.active i{color:var(--accent-ink)}
  .tier-badge.b{background:#D9CFFF;color:#10101C}
  .tier-badge.c{background:#1C1C2C;color:#C9CCDE}
  .tier-badge.d{background:#232133;color:#A3A6BC}
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html,body{margin:0;padding:0}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--sans);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
button{font-family:inherit;color:inherit}
.app{max-width:480px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--phone-bg);height:100dvh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;position:relative}
@media(min-width:520px){.app{border-left:2px solid var(--line);border-right:2px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 0 60px rgba(0,0,0,.18)}}

/* Header */
header{padding:calc(14px + env(safe-area-inset-top)) 18px 12px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--line);background:var(--phone-bg);flex-shrink:0;z-index:20}
.head-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px}
header h1{margin:0;font-size:23px;line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-weight:900}
header h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent)}
.snap{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px}
.snap b{color:var(--ink)}
.install-btn{flex-shrink:0;border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:var(--accent);color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:12px;padding:9px 12px;cursor:pointer}
.install-btn:active{transform:scale(.97)}
.install-help{display:none;margin-top:10px;border:1.5px dashed var(--line);background:var(--surface2);padding:11px 12px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6}
.install-help.show{display:block}
.install-help b{font-size:12.5px}

/* Views */
main{flex:1;min-height:0;overflow-y:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;padding:16px 18px 26px}
.view{display:none}
.view.active{display:block;animation:fade .18s ease}
@keyframes fade{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(4px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.view{animation:none}}
.label{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin:20px 0 9px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.label:first-child{margin-top:2px}
.label button{border:none;background:none;color:var(--accent);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;padding:4px 0;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em}
.card{border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);padding:14px}
.card + .card{margin-top:10px}
.dashed{border-style:dashed}
.pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:3px 7px;border:1px solid var(--line);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;white-space:nowrap}
.pill.gold{background:var(--gold-bg);border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--gold)}
.pill.green{background:var(--green-bg);color:var(--green);border-color:var(--green)}
.pill.red{background:var(--red-bg);color:var(--red);border-color:var(--red)}
.pill.type{background:var(--surface2)}
.btn{width:100%;border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:var(--ink);color:var(--phone-bg);padding:13px;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;cursor:pointer;margin-top:10px}
.btn.secondary{background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink)}
.btn.accent{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-color:var(--accent)}
.btn:active{transform:scale(.99)}
.note{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--muted);border-left:3px solid var(--accent);padding-left:10px;margin-top:18px}

/* Home */
.hero{border:2px solid var(--line);background:var(--ink);color:#FDFCF8;padding:16px}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){.hero{background:#F4F2FF;color:#0A0A16;border-color:#C4B5FD}}
.hero .label{color:inherit;opacity:.75;margin-top:0}
.hero h2{margin:4px 0 6px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.02em;font-weight:900}
.hero p{margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;opacity:.85}
.hero-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-top:14px}
.hero-stats div{border:1px solid currentColor;padding:9px;opacity:.95}
.hero-stats b{display:block;font-size:19px;line-height:1}
.hero-stats span{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9.5px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;opacity:.7;display:block;margin-top:4px}
.champ-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}
.champ{border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);padding:12px;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;width:100%}
.champ:active{transform:scale(.99)}
.champ small{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);display:block}
.champ strong{display:block;font-size:16px;line-height:1.12;margin:6px 0 4px}
.champ span{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.45;display:block}
.spotlight{border:2px solid var(--line);background:var(--gold-bg);padding:14px;width:100%;text-align:left;cursor:pointer}
.spotlight small{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);display:block;font-weight:700}
.spotlight strong{display:block;font-size:17px;line-height:1.2;margin:6px 0 4px}
.spotlight span{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink);opacity:.8;line-height:1.5;display:block}
.day-card{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);padding:12px;width:100%;text-align:left;cursor:pointer}
.day-badge{width:46px;height:46px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:var(--accent);color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:900;font-size:11px;flex-shrink:0;text-align:center;line-height:1.1}

/* Rank rows */
.rank-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;width:100%;text-align:left;border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);padding:11px 12px;margin-bottom:8px;cursor:pointer}
.rank-row:active{transform:scale(.995)}
.rank-num{width:33px;height:33px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:900;flex-shrink:0;background:var(--surface2);font-size:14px}
.rank-num.top{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-color:var(--accent)}
.rank-main{flex:1;min-width:0}
.rank-main b{display:block;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.rank-main span{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);display:block;margin-top:2px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.rank-elo{text-align:right;flex-shrink:0}
.rank-elo b{font-size:16px}
.rank-elo span{display:block;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;font-weight:600;margin-top:2px}
.up{color:var(--green)} .down{color:var(--red)} .flat{color:var(--muted)}
.recent-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;border:1.5px solid var(--line-soft);background:var(--surface);padding:10px 12px;margin-bottom:7px;font-size:13px;width:100%;text-align:left;cursor:pointer}
.recent-row .sc{font-family:var(--mono);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0}
.recent-row small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;margin-top:2px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em}

/* Beys */
.search{width:100%;border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);padding:13px 14px;font-size:16px;color:var(--ink);outline:none;font-family:var(--sans)}
.search::placeholder{color:var(--muted)}
.search:focus{border-color:var(--accent)}
.chips{display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:10px 0 6px}
.chip{border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);padding:7px 11px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
.chip.active{background:var(--ink);color:var(--phone-bg)}
.sort-row{display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:center;margin:8px 0 12px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}
.sort-row select{border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);padding:7px 8px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;font-weight:600}
.empty{border:1.5px dashed var(--line);padding:22px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}

/* Profile */
.back{border:none;background:none;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;color:var(--accent)}
.profile-head{border:2px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);padding:16px}
.profile-head h2{margin:9px 0 4px;font-size:27px;line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-weight:900}
.profile-head p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.5}
.pills{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.stat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-top:10px}
.stat{border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);padding:10px}
.stat b{display:block;font-size:17px;line-height:1.05}
.stat span{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9.5px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--muted);display:block;margin-top:5px;line-height:1.4}
.spark{border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);padding:12px;margin-top:10px}
.match-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;border:1.5px solid var(--line-soft);background:var(--surface);padding:11px 12px;margin-bottom:7px;font-size:13px;width:100%;text-align:left;cursor:pointer}
.match-row.static{cursor:default}
.match-row b{font-size:13px}
.match-row span{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;display:block;margin-top:2px}
.match-side{text-align:right;flex-shrink:0}
.result{font-family:var(--mono);font-weight:700;font-size:13px}
.result.w{color:var(--green)} .result.l{color:var(--red)}
.delta{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;display:block;margin-top:2px}

/* Compare */
.vs-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 30px 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:stretch}
.vs-grid select{width:100%;border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);padding:12px 6px;font-weight:800;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink);min-width:0}
.vs-mid{display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:900;font-size:12px;border:1.5px dashed var(--line);background:var(--surface2);cursor:pointer}
.predictor{border:2px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);padding:16px;margin-top:12px}
.bar{display:flex;height:14px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);overflow:hidden;margin:12px 0 8px}
.bar i{display:block;height:100%;transition:width .25s ease}
.bar .a{background:var(--accent)} .bar .b{background:var(--ink)}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){.bar .b{background:#F4F2FF}}
.pct{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-weight:900;font-size:22px}
.pct span:last-child{opacity:.55}
.vs-names{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;font-size:13px;font-weight:800}
.vs-names span:last-child{text-align:right}
.evidence{margin-top:12px;border-top:1px dashed var(--line-soft);padding-top:12px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--muted)}
.evidence b{color:var(--ink)}
.h2h-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-top:10px}
.h2h-grid div{border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);padding:11px 6px;text-align:center}
.h2h-grid b{display:block;font-size:17px}
.h2h-grid span{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9.5px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--muted);display:block;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.4}
.cmp-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:10px;font-size:13px}
.cmp-table th,.cmp-table td{border:1.5px solid var(--line-soft);padding:9px 8px;background:var(--surface)}
.cmp-table th{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}
.cmp-table td{text-align:center;font-weight:700}
.cmp-table td:first-child{text-align:left;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}
.cmp-table td.better{color:var(--accent)}

/* Records */
.rec-tabs{display:flex;gap:6px;overflow-x:auto;padding-bottom:4px;scrollbar-width:none;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch}
.rec-tabs::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
.rec-tab{flex-shrink:0;border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);padding:9px 12px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
.rec-tab.active{background:var(--ink);color:var(--phone-bg)}
.rec-panel{display:none;margin-top:12px} .rec-panel.active{display:block}
.leader-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;border:1.5px solid var(--line-soft);background:var(--surface);padding:10px 12px;margin-bottom:7px;width:100%;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px}
.leader-row b{font-size:14px}
.leader-row .val{margin-left:auto;font-weight:900;font-size:15px;flex-shrink:0}
.leader-row small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;margin-top:2px}
.tier{display:flex;gap:11px;align-items:flex-start;border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);padding:12px;margin-bottom:9px}
.tier-badge{width:37px;height:37px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:900;border:1.5px solid var(--line);flex-shrink:0;font-size:16px}
.tier-badge.s{background:#FFD166;color:#171A1F}.tier-badge.a{background:#BFE3C6;color:#171A1F}.tier-badge.b{background:#E3E6EA;color:#171A1F}.tier-badge.c{background:#F3F1E9;color:#171A1F}.tier-badge.d{background:#E7E0D2;color:#171A1F}
.tier h4{margin:1px 0 0;font-size:14px}
.tier p{margin:3px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}
.tier-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:8px}
.tier-chips button{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface2);padding:5px 8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
.rival{border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);padding:12px;margin-bottom:9px;width:100%;text-align:left;cursor:pointer}
.rival b{font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.3;display:block}
.rival .meta{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;margin-top:5px;display:block}
.award{display:flex;gap:12px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);padding:13px;margin-bottom:8px;width:100%;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;align-items:center}
.award-icon{width:39px;height:39px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:900;background:var(--gold-bg);flex-shrink:0;font-size:13px}
.award small{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);display:block}
.award b{display:block;margin-top:3px;font-size:15px}
.award span{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);display:block;margin-top:2px;line-height:1.45}

/* Bottom nav */
.bottom-nav{flex-shrink:0;width:100%;border-top:2px solid var(--line);background:var(--phone-bg);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);padding:7px 8px calc(7px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));z-index:30}
.nav-btn{border:none;background:none;padding:7px 2px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:4px}
.nav-btn i{width:23px;height:23px;border:1.5px solid currentColor;display:grid;place-items:center;font-style:normal;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:900}
.nav-btn.active{color:var(--ink)} .nav-btn.active i{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);color:#fff}
.toast{position:fixed;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(10px);bottom:calc(var(--nav-h) + 22px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));background:var(--ink);color:var(--phone-bg);padding:9px 14px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:.2s;white-space:nowrap;z-index:50;max-width:92vw;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0)}
footer{padding:4px 2px 0;margin-top:22px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted)}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app">
  <header>
    <div class="head-row">
      <div>
        <h1>BEYBLADE<br><em>COMPANION</em></h1>
        <p class="snap">SEASON 2 • <b>ACTIVE</b> • SNAPSHOT: REBIRTH + AFTERSHOCK + ECLIPSE<br>74 BEYS • 434 MATCHES • ELO START 1200, K=32</p>
      </div>
      <button class="install-btn" id="installBtn" type="button">＋ INSTALL</button>
    </div>
    <div class="install-help" id="installHelp">
      <b>Add it to your home screen:</b><br>
      <b>iPhone (Safari):</b> tap Share → “Add to Home Screen.”<br>
      <b>Android (Chrome):</b> tap ⋮ menu → “Add to Home screen” / “Install app.”<br>
      It opens full-screen like a real app, and this snapshot is baked into the page — it works offline once loaded.
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="main">
    <!-- HOME -->
    <section class="view active" id="view-home">
      <div class="hero">
        <div class="label"><span>Season 2 — So far</span><span>3 events</span></div>
        <h2>Bahamoot took Eclipse from seed 28 — Orochi still holds #1.</h2>
        <p>Three double-elimination events in: Bahamoot — 33rd at Aftershock — lost to Orochi in the Eclipse winners bracket, ran the losers side, then beat him twice in the Grand Finals. Orochi has made all three S2 finals, became the first bey past 1500 Elo (peak 1507.4), and still leads Bahamoot by 14.1.</p>
        <div class="hero-stats"><div><b>74</b><span>Beys played</span></div><div><b>434</b><span>Matches</span></div><div><b>834</b><span>Battle rounds</span></div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="label"><span>Champions</span><button data-nav="records" data-rec="awards" type="button">All awards →</button></div>
      <div class="champ-grid">
        <button class="champ" data-profile="24" type="button"><small>Rebirth • Oct 3</small><strong>Meteo L Drago</strong><span>Grand Final 5–4, reset 5–2 over Orochi →</span></button>
        <button class="champ" data-profile="61" type="button"><small>Aftershock • Oct 4</small><strong>Orochi</strong><span>Grand Final 6–4 over Phenix →</span></button>
        <button class="champ" data-profile="71" type="button" style="grid-column:1/-1"><small>Eclipse • Oct 9</small><strong>Bahamoot</strong><span>Seed 28 — Grand Final 6–2, reset 5–3 over Orochi →</span></button>
      </div>

      <div class="label"><span>Biggest upset</span></div>
      <button class="spotlight" data-profile="57" type="button">
        <small>▲ 175.2 Elo gap — Eclipse Winners bracket</small>
        <strong>L Drago Verdantis 4–2 Meteo L Drago</strong>
